{"id":"re_cemment","lemma":"récemment","pos":"adv","rank":1303,"glosses":["recently"],"ipa":"/ʁe.sa.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/db/Fr-r%C3%A9cemment.ogg/Fr-r%C3%A9cemment.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ils l'ont changé très récemment.","en":"They changed it very recently.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to exchange","l":"changer"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Avez-vous vu des films récemment ?","en":"Have you seen any movies lately?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"movie, film","l":"film"},null]},{"text":"Avez-vous lu de bons livres récemment ?","en":"Have you read any good books lately?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to read","l":"lire"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},{"g":"book","l":"livre"},null]},{"text":"As-tu eu des nouvelles de lui, récemment ?","en":"Have you heard from him recently?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"news"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"him, he, it"},null]},{"text":"Mon père a arrêté de fumer récemment.","en":"My father has given up smoking recently.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to stop","l":"arrêter"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to smoke"},null]}]}